PDFKit
------

The document writer is a Lua port of PDFKit 0.20.2 by Devon Govett
(https://github.com/foliojs/pdfkit, https://pdfkit.org/).

    Copyright (c) 2014 Devon Govett

PDFKit is licensed under the MIT license. A copy is in vendor/pdfkit/LICENSE.
The condition that matters here: the copyright notice and the permission
notice shall be included in all copies or substantial portions of the
Software.

vendor/pdfkit/ is the upstream reading copy and the Node oracle. It is not
part of the Lua rock.

Transcribed libraries
---------------------

These are the libraries the Lua was actually transcribed from. Each is MIT.
js-md5 is not one of them: src/pdfkit/md5.lua follows RFC 1321.
PDFKit 0.20.2 takes MD5 from @noble/hashes, which this tree does not copy.
@noble/ciphers is the same: present upstream for encryption, not transcribed
here.

